{"unit_id":"wenyixiaoqingnian__screenshot-review#card-zh","repo":"wenyixiaoqingnian/screenshot-review","commit":"74305811d367ffc5af4986394f9c2140e49d4661","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-screenshot-review 是一个面向 DSH 的前端截图审阅 skill。它在插件加载时把 SKILL.md 的操作指南注册到 DSH skills 系统，让模型按用户提出的视觉要求检查网页并迭代修改。流程包括打开目标页面、截取整页或局部画面、查看截图、对照布局和样式差距修改代码，再刷新截图确认；当差距消除或连续两轮没有明显改进时停止。适合希望通过真实页面截图反复调整前端外观的开发者。使用前需要可访问的目标网页、浏览器截图工具和图像查看能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-27","SKILL.md:24-38"]}
{"unit_id":"wenyixiaoqingnian__screenshot-review#card-en","repo":"wenyixiaoqingnian/screenshot-review","commit":"74305811d367ffc5af4986394f9c2140e49d4661","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-screenshot-review is a DSH skill for visual frontend iteration. It guides the model to capture and inspect page screenshots, identify gaps, edit code, and repeat until resolved or progress stalls. It suits developers refining a rendered page and requires browser and image viewing tools.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-27","SKILL.md:24-38"]}
